WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,640
Brother Zhanye, it’s good if you have a place to sleep in your heart.

2
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:03,760
Still haven't paid

3
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:14,580
What are you doing? Looking for death?

4
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:17,180
Lao Su, don't be impulsive

5
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:20,260
This house will rise and people will die if you live in it.

6
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:22,420
It just so happens that I don't want to live here. Let's go.

7
00:00:23,810 --> 00:00:25,090
Incompetent is furious

8
00:00:25,490 --> 00:00:27,530
If there is no room to check in at night

9
00:00:27,530 --> 00:00:28,610
He's a standout

10
00:00:28,610 --> 00:00:30,610
The rooms are all allocated

11
00:00:30,850 --> 00:00:32,970
Except for my haunted house

12
00:00:32,970 --> 00:00:34,130
Where else can you live?

13
00:00:35,480 --> 00:00:36,760
Now I regret it

14
00:00:36,760 --> 00:00:37,720
ten dollars

15
00:00:37,720 --> 00:00:39,840
I reluctantly let you live in it

16
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:42,160
How about I be generous?

17
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:43,360
As expected of Brother Wang

18
00:00:43,360 --> 00:00:45,400
Just where did these two newcomers get their money?

19
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:47,640
It seems that I am certain to die tonight.

20
00:00:47,640 --> 00:00:53,340
Mr. Su, I finally found you.

21
00:00:53,340 --> 00:00:55,260
Why do you still live in a place like this?

22
00:00:55,260 --> 00:00:56,900
This is not what a distinguished guest like you should be doing

23
00:00:56,900 --> 00:00:58,460
Manager Minna asked me to invite you here

24
00:00:58,460 --> 00:00:59,940
Go to the banquet suite on the top floor

25
00:00:59,940 --> 00:01:00,860
Entire hotel

26
00:01:00,860 --> 00:01:02,820
There is only one supreme presidential room

27
00:01:02,820 --> 00:01:05,020
The country soldiers and imperial guards are also ready.

28
00:01:05,020 --> 00:01:06,020
Please take a step
